---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<BaseLayout title="gvs" description="Software developer, tinkerer, and writer." activeNav="about">
  <div class="hero">
    <h1>Hi, I'm Venkata Sai Dutt Ganduri</h1>
    <p class="subtitle">Software developer. Tinkerer. Curious about how things work.</p>
    <div class="bio">
      <p>
        I'm a software developer at <a href="https://www.centralsquare.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">CentralSquare Technologies</a>,
        where I build public administration, public safety, and justice software.
      </p>
      <p>
        Outside of work, I build things that interest me. I wrote a
        <a href="https://github.com/saidutt46/domain-check" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Rust-based CLI tool</a> for domain availability checking
        and built <a href={`${base}blog/oareo/`}>Oareo</a>, an iOS app that turns spatial captures into 3D models.
      </p>
      <p>
        I'm drawn to understanding how things work at a fundamental level: how electrons move to make machines do things,
        how programs make hardware useful, how engines turn fuel into motion. I also care deeply about the natural world,
        spend time with bonsai plants, and look up at the sky more than most people.
      </p>
      <p>
        This site is where I write about what I'm building, learning, and thinking about.
        Check out my <a href={`${base}blog/`}>blog</a> for longer posts,
        or my <a href={`${base}notes/`}>ideas & notes</a> for rough thoughts.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="social">
      <a href="https://github.com/saidutt46" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
